From 72af382076006e026964d0ef61abbe6ce9bac656 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: c <c@l>
Date: Tue, 8 Sep 2026 14:29:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] b43: AC-PHY bring-up from the reverse-engineered port

Replaces mainline's 88-line phy_ac.c placeholder with the transcribed
bring-up: init, channel tuning, RF sequencer, TX power, the 2069 radio, the
table accessors and the RX-IQ calibration.

Regenerated from src/ rather than maintained by hand, so it cannot drift out
of sync with the tree the unit suite measures.
